      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start on the themes. I noticed the temporal indexer flagged this summary with a very low score, though, since it didn't pick up many specific date patterns. This makes it hard for the scholars to find the exact chronological context in the database.\n\nCould you expand on this summary to provide more granular detail? Specifically, try to weave in the specific dates mentioned in the records—even if they are just the various days/months throughout 1842 and 1843—so the indexer can actually track the timeline of the guild unrest. Again, please keep the professional tone and focus on the history, don't just make a list, but we definitely need those dates in there for the system to work.",
